  "narration": [
    {
      "text": "Map questions look impossible until you learn this one habit.",
      "startFrame": 4,
      "durationInFrames": 128,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Find the entrance first. Every single description starts from there.",
      "startFrame": 136,
      "durationInFrames": 129,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Question one, reception. Listen for the word left.",
      "startFrame": 269,
      "durationInFrames": 109,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Reception. Immediately on your left as you enter.",
      "startFrame": 393,
      "durationInFrames": 100,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Question two, the swimming pool. Far end, right hand side.",
      "startFrame": 497,
      "durationInFrames": 120,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Far end means the top of the plan.",
      "startFrame": 632,
      "durationInFrames": 83,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Question three, the gym. Opposite the pool.",
      "startFrame": 719,
      "durationInFrames": 97,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Opposite means straight across the corridor, so top left.",
      "startFrame": 831,
      "durationInFrames": 112,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Question four, the cafe. Between reception and the changing rooms.",
      "startFrame": 947,
      "durationInFrames": 136,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Between. So it has to be the middle room.",
      "startFrame": 1098,
      "durationInFrames": 87,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Your turn now. Two rooms left on the plan.",
      "startFrame": 1189,
      "durationInFrames": 96,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Where do the changing rooms go? And the sports hall?",
      "startFrame": 1289,
      "durationInFrames": 99,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Pause the video and mark them on your own plan.",
      "startFrame": 1392,
      "durationInFrames": 92,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Answers are in the comments. Follow for one every day.",
      "startFrame": 1488,
      "durationInFrames": 112,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    }
